  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>30</mn></math></p><p>Now it has given that&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><mo>&#8804;</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#8804;</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>6</mn></math></p><p>and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;can take any value.</p><p>Finding coefficient of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>30</mn></msup></math> in</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>30</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>5</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>7</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>6</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>30</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>31</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>5</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p>{Ignoring higher power more than <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>30</mn></math>}</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>5</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>6</mn></msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>5</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup></math>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>6</mn></msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>5</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>9</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>6</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>11</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>10</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>15</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p>Required coefficient <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>24</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>24</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mmultiscripts><mo>-</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>19</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>19</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mmultiscripts></math>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>20</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mrow><mn>20</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mmultiscripts><mo>+</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>15</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mrow><mn>15</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mmultiscripts></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>24</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>27</mn></mmultiscripts><mo>-</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>19</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>22</mn></mmultiscripts><mo>-</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>20</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>23</mn></mmultiscripts><mo>+</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>15</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>18</mn></mmultiscripts></math>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>430</mn></math></p>",
